{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_01",
  "title": "我有一个荣美家乡",
  "storyCode": "HE-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "93e46ede8684370f0cbdb0f74d5bec1fa614294ccc6d8179a67b120d320a0e5e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "这个字迹，果然是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "“本不可能有交集的人们”“不分彼此”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "确实，在最初看到那样的景象时，我也有些怀疑自己的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "如果只是作为我个人来说的话，真希望这样难得的和平能一直一直持续下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "请进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "蕾缪安小姐，你在忙吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "之前你提过的那种正在流行的图案，我和其他人尝试着绣了一些在被褥上，你看这样对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "让我看看......嗯嗯，你们的手艺很好呢，这个就算摆在商店里卖，我也不会感到奇怪的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "没你夸的这么厉害......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "现在天气凉了，蕾缪安小姐这里的被褥可能不大保暖，大家就凑了点布料送过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "谢谢关心~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "不过给我的话，你们那里会不会不够用？还是优先分给大家吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "别看我这样，其实我很强壮，不会轻易生病的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "哈哈，我们没关系的，大伙匀一匀多少还是没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "倒是蕾缪安小姐，看着也不像是很强壮的样子啊，拉特兰也真是的，怎么派蕾缪安小姐出这么远的门？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "嗯，这个嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "这个问题，我也很想问一问我的上级呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "为什么我们不回去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德尔菲娜",
      "text": "因为莱蒙德他们不能和我们一起！这个理由还不足够？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德尔菲娜",
      "text": "难道你要抛下他们？我做不到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "（笨蛋菲娜，难道我看起来是这么冷血的人吗？要把从小一起长大的朋友丢下，这我当然也做不到啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "（可是继续像现在这样僵持下去也不是办法，最近大家脾气都开始变坏了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "（真的就没有什么更好的解决方法了吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怎么了，怎么又唉声叹气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "真稀奇，怎么就你一个人，德尔菲娜竟然没和你在一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "莱蒙德！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "你这话什么意思，我和菲娜也不是时时刻刻都在一起吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "差不多吧，你们不是关系好得就差睡一张床了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "我们有时候是会一起睡......呃，不对，重点不是这个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "你什么时候回来的？我听说你跟着杰拉尔德叔叔出去狩猎了，这次还顺利吗？有没有受伤？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "你受伤了一定要说出来，千万别学杰拉尔德叔叔，什么都自己忍着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "没事，你别瞎操心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "我瞎操心？上回受伤不说最后伤口发炎的人是谁？私自去矿脉差点回不来的又是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "好，好，算我错了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "哦？“算你错了”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......是我错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "福尔图娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "其实我来是想问问你，你......还有德尔菲娜，当然，也包括其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "我是想问，你们要不要和我们一起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年的话语在中途停住了。\n他忽然沉默起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "莱蒙德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......算了，没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "一会我要出去一趟，可能得晚一点回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "福尔图娜，晚餐前你能来楼顶的圣堂一趟吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "把德尔菲娜也喊上......我有件事要告诉你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "让我看看，这是什么情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "他们在修道院旁边还建了一条街？这都建到移动地块边缘去了......修道院里的空间有这么紧张吗？明明看起来大得很欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "这里的人口有这么多吗？要养活一大群人不容易吧......特别还是在这样的荒野中央。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "进去看看就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......有人来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "嗯？啊，从里面走过来，应该是当地的居民吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "赫曼那家伙，到底去哪了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "嗨，看不清脸的帅哥，下午好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "——！什么人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "光环......你们是萨科塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "不管你们是什么人，有什么目的，都不许再靠近了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "刚见面，别这么剑拔弩张，大家都和气一点，哎，好好说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "下午好，这位先生，我们三人来自拉特兰，不是什么可疑人物，请别紧张......如果能把你手上的武器收起来就更好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "拉特兰的人来这种荒郊野岭有何贵干？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "呃，我们是受教宗阁下派遣，来这里寻找我们的两位同僚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你是在浪费时间，里凯莱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "从表现来看，我认为他很清楚我们的身份与来此的动机，并且怀有敌意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你对拉特兰很反感，表现出了明显的排斥以及不满。你的敌意从何而来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......我不知道你在说什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你一直站在通向侧方街道的入口处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你在有意挡住我们的视线。你不希望我们关注那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "那里面有什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你这家伙——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "好了，也不必这样挑衅对方，费德里科！虽然我清楚你大概没那个意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "你没忘记教宗阁下给你的任务吧？低调、低调，可千万别像之前一样乱来啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我没有挑衅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "哈，你们这些拉特兰人就是这样，突然出现，把一切都搅得一团乱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "从资料上看，这里的状况本就不容乐观。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......你再说一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "想动手吗？来啊，我奉陪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "那边还真是剑拔弩张......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "感谢费德里科总能吸引所有目光，偷跑比我想的要轻松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "不过那个戴兜帽的家伙......唔，确实不太对劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "算了，之后再算这笔账。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "得先把人找到才行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "哈哈，蕾缪安，让我猜猜看，你会在什么地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "看来今天会是客人很多的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "您好，杰拉尔德先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "我本以为能在这里见到斯特凡诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "主教阁下还有不少事务要处理，刚刚才离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "我想他应该还没走多远，以您的脚力，现在追上去应该还来得及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "......你今天还没有拉响琴弦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "如果您喜欢我的琴声的话，我可以现在就为您演奏一曲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "你给一些......我们的人带来了快乐，对此我很感激。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "但并不是所有人都可以从你的音乐中得到安慰的，至少我不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "我不知道像你这样的音乐家为何会在这个地方逗留......我只希望你不会为这里带来灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "您太高看我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "据我所知，灾难总是在最初就被埋藏在土壤里，而后生根发芽，开花结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "如果这片花圃里真有这么一粒种子，那么它迟早会破土而出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "而我......充其量只是一个将这一切纳入眼帘的过客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "......不会有什么不该发芽的种子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "要不了多久，一切都会回归正轨，不会有意外，更不会有灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "小姐，请不要做多余的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "这是您给我的忠告？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "这是我的警告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "真是有够不讲情面，不过没有直接动手，应该已经算是很手下留情了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "该说不愧是老前辈吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "哎呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破旧的男孩",
      "text": "漂亮的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破旧的女孩",
      "text": "......大姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "看来，今天确实是客人很多的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "请进，意料之外的小客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破旧的男孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破旧的女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "text": "我叫作阿尔图罗，可以知道你们的名字吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "好了好了，别这么说话，费德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我的发言并没有问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "总之你暂时先别说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "还有这位小兄弟，别冲动，我们真的只是来找下落不明的同事，不管你，嗯，不管你是什么人，我们都没有敌意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "哼，说得好听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你管他这样的叫没有敌意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "咳，我可以发誓。总之......可以先放我们进去吗？如果方便通知一下这边的负责人就最好不过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "斯普莉雅......咦，斯普莉雅人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "她已经进去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "啊？那个女人什么时候——？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "刚刚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......啧！不能让你们拉特兰的人在这撒野！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你们两个，不是要见主教阁下吗，跟我来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "哈哈......也好，这是同意我们进去的意思，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "我警告你们，别想着和那个女人一样乱跑——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "不好了！快、快来人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "克莱芒？怎么了，发生什么事了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "莱蒙德！太好了，快通知其他人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "有敌袭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "呃，是的！不对，莱蒙德，这两位是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "别管他们！具体是什么情况？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "啊，对，对......不好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "我刚刚修缮窗户时，看到不远处有些动静——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "之前的那群强盗，他们又来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
